From: sss@dark-alexandr.net
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 03:00:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] ik-llama-max-experts: raise LLAMA_MAX_EXPERTS to 1024

Kimi K3 has 896 experts, but LLAMA_MAX_EXPORTS was only 512 (set for
Qwen3 Next). Raise to 1024 to match upstream llama.cpp.

diff --git a/src/llama-hparams.cpp b/src/llama-hparams.cpp
index 0d3ae7ae..c72a14e4 100644
--- a/src/llama-hparams.cpp
+++ b/src/llama-hparams.cpp
@@ -8,7 +8,7 @@
 #include <limits>
 #include <map>
 
-#define LLAMA_MAX_EXPERTS 512  // Qwen3 Next
+#define LLAMA_MAX_EXPERTS 1024 // Kimi K3
 

 static const std::map<llama_rope_scaling_type, const char *> LLAMA_ROPE_SCALING_TYPES = {
